# Appearance > Glass / Match apps page. Plan: Glass look for most steps (G11 is Material).
look glass
ipc panels settings appearance/glass
wait 2
shot top
note G1 Material row (Glass/Frost/Solid segmented, Advanced... pill to the right, about x 1400 y 330): footer text follows the chosen option; with the plugin missing and Glass chosen: "Glass needs the tessera-glass...".
ptr move 1400 330 sleep 300 glide 1400 330 100 click
wait 1
shot advanced
note G2 FAILED before (inline under the group): Advanced opens as a 300 px wide glass popover just under the pill, 8 px gap, its right edge lined up with the pill's, floating over the Motion/Window corners rows (they must not move); the pill stays lit. Batch 2 made it its own popup.
note G3 contents: "Custom material"; Glass, Frost, Solid, Tint sliders with NN% readings and hints (Tint hint "How much it darkens what's behind" in dark, "How milky it is" in light); "Optics"; stripes preview with "Aa" centred (Rust: frosted rectangle, known difference); Index of refraction "1.50", Refraction "100%", Dispersion "35%"; "Reset to Glass" button. Readings equal the material shown before opening (sliders do not jump).
ptr move 1100 450 sleep 200 down glide 1060 450 400 up
wait 1
shot frost
note G4 dragging the Frost slider to about 30 percent: reading follows, the Material segmented gains "Custom" (300 wide) and selects it; footer "Your own mix...". Slider position is a guess: read from the advanced shot.
key -k Escape
wait 1
shot esc
note G6 Esc closes the popover and Settings stays open.
ptr move 1400 330 sleep 200 glide 1400 330 100 click
wait 1
ptr move 800 600 sleep 200 glide 800 600 100 click
wait 1
shot outside
note G6 clicking on the page left of the popover (about 800,600) closes it.
ptr move 1400 330 sleep 200 glide 1400 330 100 click sleep 150 click
wait 1
shot double
note G6 clicking the pill twice quickly: QML ends open (closes on press, reopens on click); Rust must end the same way (batch 2: a click that just closed it does not reopen it - note any difference).
# MANUAL: G4 drag Dispersion to the left end: reading "None", Material stays as it was; G5 click "Reset to Glass": Material = Glass, readings 100/75/0/75 percent, 1.50, 100 percent, 35 percent, "Custom" leaves the segmented
# MANUAL: G7 move the Settings window so its bottom is near the screen bottom (or resize to 1040x500); popover stays inside the window with a 12 px margin and scrolls inside when taller
# MANUAL: G8 Motion options, Window corners drag ("N px, continuous curve" whole numbers), Rounded screen corners toggle
# MANUAL: G9 with matugen installed Colours from is enabled; Accent shows 4 target switches and footer "Apps get colours from your accent colour..."; Off removes them, footer "Apps keep their own colours."; without matugen disabled + "Install matugen..."
# MANUAL: G10 More options: Lens row only for Glass; Compositor glass shows "Active: Hyprland draws the glass" + green check with the plugin, else "Build plugin..." accent pill; Frost over windows only with the plugin
# MANUAL: G11 Material look: title "Match apps", info row + "Show looks" (click goes to Appearance), Match apps group enabled, More options (needs the Material run of this page)
ipc panels close
